OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fand a few light showers in the
OL,7,Fevening. It will become mostly dry
OL,8,Fovernight as showers fade away. Light
OL,9,Fnorthwesterly winds. A chilly night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FThe odd light shower possible
OL,12,Fat first, most likely for Shetland.
OL,13,FOtherwise dry with bright or sunny
OL,14,Fspells and light winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBright
OL,17,Fbut breezy start Monday, soon turning
OL,18,Fcloudy with a little rain. Wet start
OL,19,FTuesday then sunshine and showers,
OL,20,Fgales. Cloudy and windy on Wednesday
OL,21,Fwith occasionally heavy rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
